{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25130","headline":"秋日登岳阳楼晴望 · 张碧","name":"秋日登岳阳楼晴望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三秋倚练飞金盏，洞庭波定平如剗。\n天高云卷绿罗低，一点君山碍人眼。\n漫漫万顷铺琉璃，烟波阔远无鸟飞。\n西南东北竞无际，直疑侵断青天涯。\n屈原回日牵愁吟，龙宫感激致应沈。\n贾生憔悴说不得，茫茫烟霭堆湖心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}